        "protectedStrength": "Compute abundance and supplier leverage.",
        "balanceBottleneck": "Income depends on rival infrastructure; its Production reward is capped at two regardless of player count.",
        "forbiddenCorrection": "Do not make the supplier compute-poor or indifferent to rivals' demand."
      }
    }
